    },
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……ん？　あそこにいるのは真乃と\r\n……誰だ？）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bgm": "002",
    "bg": "00003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020010,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……は、はい。そうです。その先を右に、曲がって……\r\nほわっ！？　い、いえいえ。それではお気をつけて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020010"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020020,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……ふう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "no2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020020"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃、どうしたの？",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020030,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020030"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うわっ！？",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020040,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "あ……プロデューサーさんでしたか\r\nほわぁ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020040"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫？\r\nさっきまで話してた人は……？",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020050,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "さっきの人には、道を聞かれたんです\r\nこの先の、郵便局に行きたかったそうで……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020060,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "でも私、あんまり上手に教えられませんでした\r\nあの人が、迷子になったらどうしましょう……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020060"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、それで心配そうな顔をしてたのか",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ちょっとだけ会話が聞こえてたけど、\r\n真乃はちゃんと説明できてたよ。充分伝わったと思う",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020070,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ～よかったです\r\n安心しましたっ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020080,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "急に道を聞かれたから、\r\n私、びっくりしちゃって……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020090,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "もっと落ち着いて、わかりやすくお伝えできたら\r\n良かったんですけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020090"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういう心配ってあるよな\r\nでも突然のことなら仕方ないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charAnim3": "blank"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020100,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……はい\r\n私って、急にお話がくるとあわあわしちゃうんです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020110,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "もっと上手にお話できたらって思うんですけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020110"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だったら、話す練習でもしてみるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000,
    "bgEffect": "mask",
    "bg": "00001"
  },
  {
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それじゃあ、\r\n急に話を振られた時の練習を始めてみようか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺が話を振るからそれに応えてみて",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020120,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "は、はいっ\r\nよろしくお願いしますっ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020120"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（そこまで緊張しなくても……\r\n何か真乃がリラックスして応えられる話題を……）",
    "textCtrl": "l"
  },
  {
    "select": "お出かけが好き\r\nなんだって？",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "植物に詳しいんだって？",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "どんな公園が\r\n好きなんだ？",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お出かけが好きなんだって？",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020130,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……はい。お日様の光を浴びながら、\r\nお散歩するのが好きです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020130"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "歩いていくなら……やっぱり公園とかか？",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020140,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ、公園は大好きでよく行きます\r\nでも、街に行って、お買い物するのも好きです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020150,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "全然知らないところへ行って、商店街を回ったりするのも\r\n初めて見るものがあったりで、とっても楽しいんです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020150"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、真乃はいろんなところに行ってるんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020160,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はい。お散歩してたら、いつの間にか\r\n遠くまでお出かけしちゃってることが多いんです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020160"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは、真乃の良いところだね",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アイドルは、仕事を通していろんな場所に行けるんだ\r\n真乃なら、アイドルの仕事を楽しんでいけるね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020170,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "私の好きなお散歩みたいに、アイドルの仕事を楽しむ……\r\n私、とってもわくわくしてきました",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020180,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "私がこれからどこまで進んでいけるか、\r\nまだよくわかりませんけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020190,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "素敵な場所に行けるように、頑張りますねっ\r\nむんっ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020190"
  },
  {
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "2"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "植物に詳しいんだって？",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020200,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はい。道の端っこにある樹や、お花を見て回ってます\r\n季節が変わったら咲く花も変わって、面白いです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020210,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "後は……山に咲いているお花を見にいったりもします",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020210"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "山にも行くんだ？\r\n結構行動力あるんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020220,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "外に出ていろんなものを見て回るのが好きなんです\r\nふふっ、私……山菜にもくわしいんですよっ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020230,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "山菜を使ったお料理も好きで、よく美味しく頂くんです\r\n心がとってもあったかくなって……ほわほわ～ってなります",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020230"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "山菜を使った料理か……本当に美味しそうだ",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020240,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ\r\nそうだ、今度作ったとき事務所に持ってきますね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020250,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "みんなにも食べてもらえたらなぁ……\r\n山菜のかき揚げは……アツアツのほうがいいし……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020260,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "山菜の……おにぎりなら？　それならいいかも\r\n頑張って作りますね、むんっ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020260"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことまで考えてくれて、ありがとうな\r\n真乃の手作り、楽しみに待ってるよ"
  },
  {
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "3"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どんな公園が好きなんだ？"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020270,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわっ\r\nそれは、難しい質問ですね……む～ん……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020280,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "あのおっきな公園も気持ちがいいですし……\r\nあ、すぐ近くの自然公園も……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020280"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（悩ませすぎてしまったか……？）",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020290,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……あっ、今一番のお気に入りは、\r\n事務所のすぐ近くにある、いつもの公園ですっ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020290"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020300,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ちょっと疲れちゃったときも、\r\nあの公園に行けば元気になれるんです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020300"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それが、真乃の元気の源なんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020310,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ\r\nお話してたら、今日も行きたくなってきました",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020310"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020320,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "あ……こんなにのんびりお話ししてたら、\r\n上手にお話しする練習にはなりませんよね……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020320"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いいや、真乃は考え迷いながらも、\r\nちゃんと終わり方の用意された話をした",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "一生懸命に話をしようとする真乃は……\r\nアイドルとして、いいＭＣができるんじゃないかな",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001004020330,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ、ＭＣ……\r\n私にできるでしょうか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100402/2001004020330"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、大丈夫\r\n真乃ならできるって、俺は信じてるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
